@startuml monte-carlo
!theme plain
title Сценарий «Monte Carlo прогноз доставки спринта»

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundCorner 6

actor "Scrum Master" as SM
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Caddy" as Caddy
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant "Middleware" as MW
participant "Analytics\nHandler" as AnaH
participant "Forecast\nCache (LRU, 15м)" as Cache
participant "Monte Carlo\nSimulator" as MC
participant "Storage" as Storage
database "PostgreSQL\n(sprint_stats,\nmv_throughput)" as PG

== Открытие страницы аналитики спринта ==
SM -> Browser : Переход на\nPages > Sprint > Analytics
Browser -> Caddy : GET /api/v1/projects/{pid}\n/sprints/{sid}/forecast

Caddy -> API : forward
API -> MW : authn + tenant + rbac (≥Viewer)
MW -> AnaH : Forecast(ctx, projectId, sprintId)

== Проверка кэша ==
AnaH -> Cache : Get(projectId, sprintId)

alt Cache hit (свежий <15 мин)
  Cache --> AnaH : ForecastResult
  AnaH --> MW : 200 + body
  note right of AnaH
    Быстрый путь —
    милисекунды.
  end note
else Cache miss или stale

  == Сбор входных данных ==
  AnaH -> Storage : GetSprintInProgress(sprintId)
  Storage -> PG : SELECT * FROM sprints\nWHERE id = $1 AND status = 'active'
  PG --> Storage : Sprint
  Storage --> AnaH : Sprint

  AnaH -> Storage : CountRemainingTasks(sprintId)
  Storage -> PG : SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM tasks WHERE sprint_id=$1\nAND closed_at IS NULL
  PG --> Storage : N = 12
  Storage --> AnaH : 12

  AnaH -> Storage : GetThroughputHistory(projectId,\nlastNSprints=5)
  Storage -> PG : SELECT throughput_tasks\nFROM sprint_stats\nWHERE project_id=$1\nORDER BY sprint.start_at DESC\nLIMIT 5
  PG --> Storage : [11, 14, 9, 13, 10]
  Storage --> AnaH : history

  == Проверка порога данных ==
  alt History < 3 спринтов
    AnaH --> MW : 200 + {status: "insufficient_data",\nmin_sprints: 3}
    note right of AnaH
      Min-data threshold:
      меньше 3 спринтов =
      "данных мало".
    end note
  else Достаточно истории

    == Расчёт Monte Carlo ==
    AnaH -> MC : Simulate(\nremainingTasks=12,\ndaysLeft=10,\nthroughput=history,\nnSimulations=1000)

    MC -> MC : Для каждой\nиз 1000 симуляций:\n\n1. Инициализировать t=0, closed=0\n2. Пока closed < N:\n   sample daily throughput\n   из empirical distribution\n   closed += sampledDaily\n   t += 1 день\n3. Записать t в результаты

    MC -> MC : Сортировка результатов\n(P50, P85, P95)
    MC -> MC : p_on_time =\n#{symulations где t ≤ daysLeft} / 1000

    MC --> AnaH : ForecastResult{\n  p_on_time: 0.78,\n  p50_days: 9,\n  p85_days: 11,\n  p95_days: 13,\n  samples: 1000,\n  explanation: "..."\n}

    == Кэширование ==
    AnaH -> Cache : Put(projectId, sprintId,\nresult, ttl=15m)
    Cache --> AnaH : ok
  end

  AnaH --> MW : 200 + ForecastResult
end

MW --> API : ForecastResult
API --> Caddy : JSON response
Caddy --> Browser : 200

Browser -> Browser : Рендер\nMonteCarloCard
Browser --> SM : «С вероятностью 78%\nспринт будет закрыт в срок.\nP85 = 11 дней, P95 = 13 дней\n(по 1000 симуляций на истории\n5 предыдущих спринтов)»

@enduml
